Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.31,0:00:07.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Miwa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.23,0:00:09.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miwa, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.69,0:00:12.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Momo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:14.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Momo"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:16.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, call me whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:20.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about... Momotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.01,0:00:25.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.\NSo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.77,0:00:30.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was... molested.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:32.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.87,0:00:35.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was the same person every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.97,0:00:39.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One day, I {screwed}gathered up my courage and grabbed his arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I shouted for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.24,0:00:43.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did it work out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:47.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Everyone around us pinned him down for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.59,0:00:48.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.10,0:00:51.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.12,0:00:54.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not even that feminine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.67,0:00:57.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't really get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:00:59.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:01.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:04.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.05,0:01:06.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.23,0:01:11.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that guy was an executive at my dad's company.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.73,0:01:13.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.92,0:01:16.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My dad got fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.69,0:01:20.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My mom asked why I couldn't just put up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.26,0:01:24.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She said being groped just shows how cute I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.77,0:01:31.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That he picked me because I'm so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.82,0:01:37.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Calm down. None of that is your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.14,0:01:39.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.03,0:01:44.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Momotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.24,0:01:49.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.57,0:01:52.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\NSure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.12,0:01:57.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have broad shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.15,0:02:01.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.53,0:03:35.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.39,0:03:37.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't just run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.16,0:03:39.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What else am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:43.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we've got to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.59,0:03:45.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't in this mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:48.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, on my own...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:50.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.27,0:03:54.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.77,0:04:08.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai.\NCould you use this for something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.72,0:04:09.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.73,0:04:12.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Penlights?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.99,0:04:15.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.59,0:04:28.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.28,0:04:31.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Come at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.96,0:04:46.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want me to touch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.69,0:04:49.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Adults can tell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:52.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me how much you want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.49,0:04:55.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just touch your wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:57.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got married because you love each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:02.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come out already!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.75,0:05:04.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.72,0:05:07.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.26,0:05:11.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:13.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:15.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!{TODO too fast?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.17,0:05:22.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What'd you rather be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.77,0:05:25.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Skewered, or turned to stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:27.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.54,0:05:29.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Skewered it is, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.85,0:05:32.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Females have expiration dates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:40.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Momotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:42.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.20,0:05:46.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a perverted brat who loves being touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:50.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on; I'll make you feel {\i1}real {\i0}good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:51.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.93,0:05:52.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:57.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.60,0:06:03.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miko, Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:08.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this song?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.46,0:06:14.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A real Yu-Yu fan couldn't skewer another fan\Nwhile Yu-Yu is watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:17.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai, raise the penlights!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.05,0:06:19.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wave them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.49,0:06:22.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.55,0:06:37.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Mako!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:39.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.60,0:06:41.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got to go after her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.52,0:06:44.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was actually excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.25,0:06:48.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was, like, thrilling and suspenseful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.37,0:06:50.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.85,0:06:56.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you did it because I'm cute, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.51,0:06:58.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:02.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Finally, we understand each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.24,0:07:11.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.97,0:07:16.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NBe gentle, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.57,0:07:18.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.48,0:07:20.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:23.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Touch me.{TODO brain or no?}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.89,0:07:42.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:47.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.15,0:08:03.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You tricked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.69,0:08:05.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:08.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die than be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.53,0:08:15.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Women... are quick to deceive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.88,0:08:18.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:21.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:25.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.09,0:08:28.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stupid brats are all just prey to adults!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:41.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll hit you with a shot to the heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.44,0:08:47.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.16,0:08:53.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're immortal in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.21,0:08:56.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, we get fixed over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.19,0:09:00.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.75,0:09:02.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:02.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.97,0:09:06.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We a unit again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.74,0:09:07.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.23,0:09:13.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to go colorfully?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.48,0:09:17.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to go colorfully?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.55,0:09:26.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.65,0:09:35.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.70,0:09:49.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.06,0:09:51.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:05.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You overdid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.63,0:10:26.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was just {a}one day, but I fell in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.10,0:10:28.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:32.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad that I got to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.35,0:10:36.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I stay like this until I disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.08,0:10:38.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.71,0:10:52.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.21,0:11:00.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah! She's getting warmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.01,0:11:03.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've become fans of you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.34,0:11:05.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.72,0:11:07.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd come running to see your debut.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.81,0:11:10.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way. I'm not having a debut.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.81,0:11:12.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're your number one fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:14.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.65,0:11:15.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:30.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just too soon to discharge you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.70,0:11:33.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Getting your muscles back in shape takes time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.13,0:11:45.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:49.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got out early, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:50.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you and the Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.25,0:11:56.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems like fighting there puts \Na heavy strain on our bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:11:59.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like high-altitude training?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.70,0:12:00.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.69,0:12:04.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, I think\NI've gotten some definition on my abs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.53,0:12:07.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not join a sports club and test them out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.82,0:12:11.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, but you don't go to school, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.33,0:12:17.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like school is all there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:20.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But my mom expects me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.67,0:12:23.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't go to school either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.05,0:12:25.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And no one complains?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.22,0:12:26.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.92,0:12:28.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.51,0:12:30.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where to next?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.13,0:12:32.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd go buy an Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.97,0:12:35.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mind if I join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.03,0:12:36.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.51,0:12:40.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neiru?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.07,0:12:41.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.98,0:12:45.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got to make a stop first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.04,0:12:47.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.41,0:12:56.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, about Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.01,0:12:56.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:12:58.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.37,0:13:03.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess she's contrarian, or her \Nattitude doesn't match her feelings.{TODO what}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.30,0:13:07.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't she out to get her "wallet" back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:08.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.26,0:13:11.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's just what she says. I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:13.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.11,0:13:23.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's huge. {TODO brain?}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.27,0:13:25.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your dad's work?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:33.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're trusting, Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.62,0:13:34.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You forgive easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:37.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean, what I said?{TODO jeez}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:38.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.78,0:13:41.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess so. I'm hopeless that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.67,0:13:45.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're lovely that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.73,0:13:49.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're hopeless {\i1}and{\i0} lovely that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.51,0:13:54.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We need someone like that \Nsometimes, or we'll never be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.69,0:13:57.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.54,0:14:00.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. This is my friend, Ohto Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.06,0:14:03.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my first secretary, Tanabe Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.27,0:14:05.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello, Ms. Ohto.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:07.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.77,0:14:11.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your recovery, President.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.17,0:14:12.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.49,0:14:15.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,President?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.20,0:14:21.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are other girls tackling Eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:23.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like who?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.04,0:14:26.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A sunflower, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:27.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:29.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.34,0:14:32.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're a bit eccentric,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.89,0:14:34.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but they're all good kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.89,0:14:35.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Try to make friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:37.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A sunflower, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.27,0:14:40.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've never eaten French fries?!\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:44.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're crunchy and super tasty when they're hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.94,0:14:46.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not so great cold, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:47.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:51.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\t(3277,5196,\c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\4c&H010101&)}Oh, but you know, there's a trick\Nto reheating them in the oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:14:57.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a women-only car!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.16,0:15:00.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stupid man! If you want to ride, get it out!{TODO uhh}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.37,0:15:01.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll chop it off for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.71,0:15:06.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have a right to ride in this car, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.11,0:15:09.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you trying to say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.46,0:15:12.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm saying\Nthat I'm a girl, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.93,0:15:15.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.97,0:15:20.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.15,0:15:26.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Momotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.11,0:15:30.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My real name is Momoe. Sawaki Momoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.40,0:15:33.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really are a girl, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.84,0:15:36.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to trick you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.87,0:15:40.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think a masculine style suits me better?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.54,0:15:42.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:47.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if you're a girl, I've still fallen in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.21,0:15:48.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:53.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to disappear.\NI want to stay with you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.40,0:16:10.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You're warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.69,0:16:14.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are more than you'd think, Haruka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.57,0:16:18.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Girls like you, who say they love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:34.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.78,0:17:05.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I forgot my wallet.\NWould you mind—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.74,0:17:06.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.83,0:17:08.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't bring it on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.21,0:17:13.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My daddy says a beautiful woman shouldn't carry a wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:17.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus, my little wallet's running late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.07,0:17:19.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai isn't your wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:23.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.81,0:17:25.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then stop. It's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.95,0:17:28.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.28,0:17:40.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:44.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.80,0:17:44.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.04,0:17:45.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like a host!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.75,0:17:47.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A host?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.37,0:17:50.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, there are guys, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.58,0:17:53.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That makes sense. Boys kill themselves, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:56.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acca, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.51,0:17:57.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There should be no boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.05,0:18:01.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Boys' and girls' suicides mean different things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.22,0:18:04.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Men are goal-oriented, women are emotion-oriented.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.26,0:18:09.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Women are impulsive and easily\Ninfluenced by others' voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.05,0:18:11.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like human relationships?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.73,0:18:12.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:15.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Imagine a "temptation of death."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.58,0:18:17.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A temptation of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.40,0:18:19.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.85,0:18:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I think I kind of get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.61,0:18:25.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Some might be led astray by the temptation and regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.49,0:18:29.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This place exists for those who want to\Nreturn children like that to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.33,0:18:33.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, don't get hung up on gender.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:36.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you shouldn't discriminate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.05,0:18:37.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.90,0:19:00.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:05.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:07.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.72,0:19:09.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:11.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.67,0:19:17.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now, {how do I look}what do I look like to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.38,0:19:18.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:21.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like a crying girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:23.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.05,0:19:29.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A crying girl... who looks like a model.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.02,0:19:30.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A sunflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.01,0:19:36.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This? It's my favorite, so it's practically all I wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.73,0:19:38.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:42.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it's really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.40,0:19:45.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.66,0:19:52.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Models all have amazing contours\Nfrom their necks to their collarbones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.83,0:19:53.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.96,0:19:54.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.08,0:19:56.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw models a lot when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.84,0:19:57.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.13,0:20:01.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My mom used to be editor-in-chief of a fashion magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.42,0:20:05.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh! Neiru! Come look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.84,0:20:07.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't her neck super pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.17,0:20:11.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like a model's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.39,0:20:16.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right. It's long and slender.\NAnd no Adam's apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.35,0:20:19.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You like Adam's apples, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.98,0:20:23.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me, too.\NI like Adam's apples, too! They're sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.86,0:20:25.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't they, though?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.65,0:20:26.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They seem so firm!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.03,0:20:28.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know what you mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.62,0:20:29.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.33,0:20:32.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about my neck, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.45,0:20:34.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it nice and inviting?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.79,0:20:36.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like a puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.79,0:20:38.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A puppy? A puppy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.38,0:20:42.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bow-wow-wow, lend me some cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.92,0:20:43.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:47.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.34,0:20:49.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.19,0:21:04.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're laughing too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.15,0:21:05.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go buy Eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.07,0:21:08.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.\NHey, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.07,0:21:11.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me? Sawaki Momoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.99,0:21:13.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.08,0:21:15.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sawaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.38,0:22:47.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To be continued.
